# Hide on the Ceiling: "at the beginning of the NEXT end step". Cast during Bot1's own end step, after that end step has begun, the next one to
# begin is Bot2's on turn 4 (CR 603.7): the Ornithopter stays in exile through Bot2's turn and comes back at the beginning of its end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Hide on the Ceiling
Plains x3
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hide on the Ceiling.Cast(X: 1)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Exile = Ornithopter
[T4 Bot2.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Exile.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Ornithopter
